OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Frain in the north during the evening
OL,7,Fwill clear by midnight. Dry conditions
OL,8,Fand clear spells in the south will
OL,9,Fspread north from the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FMorning mist, fog patches. The
OL,12,Fday will be dry, bright for most,
OL,13,Fcloud will increase in the far south
OL,14,Fwhere the odd shower is likely later.
OL,15,FScattered showers W Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
