OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBands
OL,6,Fof rain and showers will push
OL,7,Fnortheast through this period. These
OL,8,Fbands will be interspersed with
OL,9,Foccasional spells of drier and
OL,10,Fbrighter conditions.
